- Function
    ...
    Understand Foundation
        - Alphabet of Human Thought
            - every concept is reduced to primitive elements
            - every complex idea expressible as a combination of those elements
            - every argument is verifiable like arithmetic
        - Pragmatic
            - An idea becomes clear after the connections to other ideas are defined
            - Knowledge holds its shape best as a tree of plain text, not prose or diagrams
        - Aristotelian
            - You never think from nothing; every new thought extends structures you already know
            - Place each thing by its genus, then add the differentia that sets it apart
    Iterate Over Extension
        ...
        Create New Language
            ...
            Install Dependency
            Create Yo Code Extension
                ...
                Go To Terminal
                Change Path To Where You Want To Save The File
                Type `yo code` Into Terminal
                Follow Prompt
                    what type of extension do you want to create: New Language Support
                    url or file to import, or none for new: ENTER
                    extension name: alphabet of thought
                    extension identifier: aot
                    extension description: alphabet of thought
                    language id: aot
                    language name: alphabet of thought
                    file extension: .aot
                    scope name: source.aot
                    initialise git repository: Yes
            Create Grammar: TextMate
                update file: aot.tmLanguage.json
                update file: language-configuration.json
        Make Change
            Run `python install.py` Command
                ...
                Update Package Version
                    Update Version Number
                        file: package.json
                        attribute: "version"
                    Run `npx @vscode/vsce package` Command
                Update Local Extension
                    Run Command: code --install-extension .\alphabet-of-thought-1.1.2.vsix --force
                    Reload VS Code For the new version to take effect: Ctrl+Shift+P → "Developer: Reload Window"
                    Verify The New Version Loaded (Extensions panel shows the new version number)
                Update Remote Extension
            Make Changes To Marketplace
                Go To Link: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/manage/publishers/Jakus
                Click `...` `More Actions` Button
                Click DropDown: Update
                Drag Vsix File Into Visual Studio Code Window
                click button: Install
                click button: Reload
            Upload Changes To GitHub
    Publish File
        Create File
            file extension: aot
            - plain text, not prose
            - a tree, not a diagram
